{"id":"grade8-u3-l4","title":"Prépositions, à ou en, et mots interrogatifs","unit":"Le voyage","language":"fr","contentSource":"curriculum-aligned lesson framework","vocabulary":[{"word":"à","translation":"إلى / في","image":"📍","example":"Je vais à Paris."},{"word":"en","translation":"بـ / في","image":"🌍","example":"Je voyage en avion."},{"word":"où","translation":"أين","image":"❓","example":"Où est la gare ?"},{"word":"quand","translation":"متى","image":"⏰","example":"Quand pars-tu ?"},{"word":"comment","translation":"كيف","image":"💬","example":"Comment vas-tu ?"},{"word":"pourquoi","translation":"لماذا","image":"❓","example":"Pourquoi voyages-tu ?"}],"grammar":{"explanation":"Utiliser à et en avec les lieux et les moyens de transport, puis poser des questions simples avec où, quand, comment et pourquoi.","examples":[{"fr":"Je vais à Paris.","ar":"أذهب إلى باريس."},{"fr":"Je voyage en avion.","ar":"أسافر بالطائرة."},{"fr":"Où est la gare ?","ar":"أين محطة القطار؟"}]},"conversation":{"lines":[{"speaker":"Sara","fr":"Comment vas-tu à Paris ?","ar":"كيف تذهب إلى باريس؟"},{"speaker":"Adam","fr":"Je voyage en train.","ar":"أسافر بالقطار."},{"speaker":"Sara","fr":"Quand pars-tu ?","ar":"متى ستغادر؟"},{"speaker":"Adam","fr":"Je pars demain.","ar":"سأغادر غدًا."}]},"practice":[{"question":"أكمل: Je vais ___ Paris.","options":["à","en","où"],"answer":0},{"question":"أكمل: Je voyage ___ avion.","options":["en","à","quand"],"answer":0},{"question":"ما أداة السؤال عن المكان؟","options":["où","quand","pourquoi"],"answer":0},{"question":"ما أداة السؤال عن الوقت؟","options":["quand","où","comment"],"answer":0}],"assessment":{"questions":[{"question":"اختر الجملة الصحيحة.","options":["Je vais à Paris.","Je vais en Paris.","Je à Paris vais."],"answer":0},{"question":"اختر أداة السؤال المناسبة: ___ voyages-tu ?","options":["Pourquoi","Où","Quand"],"answer":0}],"status":"standardized"}
